@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Resumefolio | File admission and truthful outcomes
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify actor, target resource, operation and effective policy;
if (Required resource/action authority present?) then (yes)
 :Evaluate applicable content, size, quota and resource conditions;
 if (Admission conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Perform required processing and association;
  if (Completion conditions and applicable limits hold?) then (yes)
   :Expose usable success and consistent accounting; <<#173B34>>
  else (failure / interruption)
   :Do not expose partial work as successful content; <<#49351C>>
   :Preserve retained references; apply agreed failure / cleanup rules;
  endif
 else (no)
  :Reject or report the defined admission failure; <<#49351C>>
 endif
else (no)
 :Deny protected operation without unrelated disclosure; <<#49351C>>
endif
:Report the actual bounded outcome to the authorized context;
stop
legend bottom
Conceptual behavior, not a storage design or selected transaction/validation order.
Concurrent admissions must obey the agreed quota; a single early check is not sufficient evidence.
Numerical limits, formats, retention, cleanup timing and feedback rules require decisions.
endlegend
@enduml
